{
  "Absolute value function. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>abs</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>abs</color-fn>(-5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>5</tt>"
  "绝对值函数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>abs</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>abs</color-fn>(-5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>5</tt>"
}
{
  "Differentiates a function. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>diff</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>diff</color-fn>(x^2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2*x</tt>"
  "对一个函数进行求导。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>diff</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>diff</color-fn>(x^2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2*x</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the exponential function, that is <formula-frml_e_pow_x-base />. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>exp</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>exp</color-fn>(1)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2.718</tt>"
  "计算指数函数，即 <formula-frml_e_pow_x-base />。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>exp</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>exp</color-fn>(1)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2.718</tt>"
}
{
  "Integer part function. Returns the highest integer not larger than the parameter. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>floor</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>floor</color-fn>(3.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>3</tt>"
  "整数部分函数。返回不大于参数的最大整数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>floor</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>floor</color-fn>(3.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>3</tt>"
}
{
  "Fractional part, the difference between this number and its integer part. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Examples:<br /> <tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(3.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.2</tt><br /> <tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(-2.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.8</tt>"
  "小数部分，即该数与其整数部分之间的差值。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(3.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.2</tt><br /> \n<tt><color-fn>frac</color-fn>(-2.2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.8</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the greatest common divisor of two numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>gcd</color-fn>(n, k)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>gcd</color-fn>(12, 8)</tt> &rarr; <tt>4</tt>"
  "计算两个数的最大公约数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>gcd</color-fn>(n, k)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>gcd</color-fn>(12, 8)</tt> &rarr; <tt>4</tt>"
}
{
  "Indefinite integral. Needs network connection to work. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>int</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>int</color-fn>(x^2/2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>x^3</tt>"
  "不定积分。需要网络连接才能工作。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>int</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>int</color-fn>(x^2/2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>x^3</tt>"
}
{
  "Definite integral. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>intd</color-fn>(expr, start, end)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>intd</color-fn>(x, 0, 10)</tt> &rarr; <tt>50</tt>"
  "定积分。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>intd</color-fn>(expr, start, end)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>intd</color-fn>(x, 0, 10)</tt> &rarr; <tt>50</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the least common multiplier of two numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>lcm</color-fn>(n, k)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>lcm</color-fn>(12, 8)</tt> &rarr; <tt>24</tt>"
  "计算两个数的最小公倍数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>lcm</color-fn>(n, k)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>lcm</color-fn>(12, 8)</tt> &rarr; <tt>24</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates natural logarithm (base <i>e</i> logarithm). Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>ln</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>ln</color-fn>(e)</tt> &rarr; <tt>1</tt>"
  "计算自然对数（以 <i>e</i> 为底的对数）。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>ln</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>ln</color-fn>(e)</tt> &rarr; <tt>1</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates 10-based logarithm. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>log</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>log</color-fn>(100)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
  "计算以 10 为底的对数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>log</color-fn>(num)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>log</color-fn>(100)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the average of a list of numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>mean</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>mean</color-fn>(1,2,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2.75</tt>"
  "计算一组数字的平均值。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>mean</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>mean</color-fn>(1,2,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2.75</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the median of a list of numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>median</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>median</color-fn>(1,3,100)</tt> &rarr; <tt>3</tt>"
  "计算一组数字的中位数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>median</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>median</color-fn>(1,3,100)</tt> &rarr; <tt>3</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the remainder of <i>n</i> after dividing by <i>r</i>. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>mod</color-fn>(n, r)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>mod</color-fn>(17, 5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
  "计算 <i>n</i> 除以 <i>r</i> 的余数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>mod</color-fn>(n, r)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>mod</color-fn>(17, 5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates <formula-frml_n_choose_k />, the number of <i>k</i> combinations from <i>n</i> elements. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>nCr</color-fn>(n,k)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>nCr</color-fn>(5,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>10</tt>"
  "计算 <formula-frml_n_choose_k />，即从 <i>n</i> 个元素中取 <i>k</i> 个组合的数量。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>nCr</color-fn>(n,k)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>nCr</color-fn>(5,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>10</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the number of <i>k</i> permutations from <i>n</i> elements, equals to <formula-frml_n_perm_k /> Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>nPr</color-fn>(n,k)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>nPr</color-fn>(5,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>20</tt>"
  "计算从 <i>n</i> 个元素中取 <i>k</i> 个排列的数量，等于 <formula-frml_n_perm_k />。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>nPr</color-fn>(n,k)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>nPr</color-fn>(5,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>20</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the probability density function of the normal distribution (also called Gaussian distribution). The formula of the density function is<br/> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<formula-frml_normal_distribution />,<br/> where μ is the mean and σ is the standard deviation. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>normal</color-fn>(x, mu, sigma)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>normal</color-fn>(1,0,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.17</tt>"
  "计算正态分布（也称为高斯分布）的概率密度函数。密度函数的公式为<br/> \n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<formula-frml_normal_distribution />，<br/> \n其中 μ 是均值，σ 是标准差。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>normal</color-fn>(x, mu, sigma)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>normal</color-fn>(1,0,2)</tt> &rarr; <tt>0.17</tt>"
}
{
  "Solves an equation, only finds a single solution. If the '=' sign is not provided, it solves for zero. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> Examples:<br /> <tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(x^2=4)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt><br /> <tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(x+3)</tt> &rarr; <tt>-3</tt><br />"
  "求解方程，仅找到一个解。如果没有提供 '=' 符号，则求解为零。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(expr)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(x^2=4)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt><br /> \n<tt><color-fn>solve</color-fn>(x+3)</tt> &rarr; <tt>-3</tt><br />"
}
{
  "Calculates the standard deviation (the square root of variance) of a list of numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>stddev</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>stddev</color-fn>(1,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
  "计算一组数字的标准差（方差的平方根）。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>stddev</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>stddev</color-fn>(1,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>2</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates Taylor series. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>taylor</color-fn>(expr, center, order)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>taylor</color-fn>(sin(x), 0, 3)</tt> &rarr; <tt>x-x^3/3!</tt>"
  "计算泰勒级数。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>taylor</color-fn>(expr, center, order)</tt><br /><br /> 示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>taylor</color-fn>(sin(x), 0, 3)</tt> &rarr; <tt>x-x^3/3!</tt>"
}
{
  "Calculates the variance of a list of numbers. Syntax: <br /> <tt><color-fn>var</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> Example:<br /> <tt><color-fn>var</color-fn>(1,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>4</tt>"
  "计算一组数字的方差。语法：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>var</color-fn>(x1, x2, x3, …)</tt><br /><br /> \n示例：<br /> \n<tt><color-fn>var</color-fn>(1,3,5)</tt> &rarr; <tt>4</tt>"
}
