{
  "Use Ans to get the result from the previous row. You can also chain calculations by using Ans in each row. This lets you easily update your results, just press Enter on each row."
  "使用Ans从上一行获取结果。您还可以通过在每一行中使用Ans来链接计算，您可以用来轻松更新结果，只需在每行按Enter键。"
}
{
  "You can long click on the name of a function to get help. It explains its usage and gives examples."
