}
{
  "Don't want to see ads? You can watch videos that turn off ads and also give you some of the premium features!"
  "若您不想看到广告，可以观看一段视频后暂时关闭广告，同时获得一些高级功能体验权限。"
}
{
  "Send easily your calculations to anyone by long-clicking on a calculation and selecting Share. You can send the results over e-mail / texts / Messenger / whatever you prefer."
  "通过长按计算并选择“共享”，可以轻松地将计算结果发送给他人。您可以通过电子邮件/短信/Messenger等任何您喜欢的方式发送结果。"
}
{
  "Turn on tracing in the plot screen by clicking the button in the lower right corner. This will let you to inspect the graphs at any locations."
  "单击右下角的按钮，能在绘图屏幕中启用跟踪，这将允许您在任何位置检查图表。"
